\f0\fs24 \cf0 These scripts form a data pipeline that:\
1. downloads the GeoNet earthquake catalogue\
2. compiles the monthly catalogue files\
3. downloads Felt RAPID observations\
4. adds GeoNet moment-tensor information\
5. adds processed strong-motion information\
6. constructs an earthquake\'96Felt RAPID cell dataset;\
7. extracts Vs30 site-condition values.\
\
The Foster et al. New Zealand Vs30 GeoTIFF file must be downloaded from (https://ucdigitalsms.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/QuakeCore/pages/3291711635/Vs30+with+QGIS) and placed in a user-created folder named "vs30" within the \'93data_raw\'94 folder.}